---
import Legal from '@/layouts/Legal.astro';
import { LEGAL, PRICING } from '@/config/site';
---

<Legal title="Refunds & cancellation" description="Money-back guarantee, cancelling a subscription and the EU right of withdrawal.">
  <h2>{PRICING.guaranteeDays}-day money-back guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    Not the right fit? Email <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a> within {PRICING.guaranteeDays} days of
    your first payment. We refund the full amount to your original payment method — no questions, no forms — and your
    license is deactivated.
  </p>

  <h2>Cancelling a monthly subscription</h2>
  <p>
    Cancel anytime from the billing portal (linked in your receipt and on your welcome page) or by email. You keep access
    until the end of the month you’ve paid for; there are no further charges.
  </p>

  <h2>Right of withdrawal for consumers in the EU</h2>
  <p>
    If you are a consumer, you have the right to withdraw from this contract within 14 days without giving any reason.
    The withdrawal period is 14 days from the day the contract is concluded. To exercise it, inform us
    ({LEGAL.company}, {LEGAL.street}, {LEGAL.city}, {LEGAL.country}, <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a>,
    {LEGAL.phone}) by a clear statement (e.g. an email). You may use the model form below, but you don’t have to. It is
    enough to send your notice before the period expires.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Consequences:</strong> if you withdraw, we refund all payments received from you without undue delay and at
    the latest within 14 days, using the same means of payment you used.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Early expiry for digital content:</strong> your right of withdrawal expires once we have started delivering the
    Software, if you expressly agreed that we begin before the withdrawal period ends and confirmed you know you lose
    your right of withdrawal this way. The voluntary money-back guarantee above still applies either way.
  </p>

  <h3>Model withdrawal form</h3>
  <p>
    To {LEGAL.company}, {LEGAL.street}, {LEGAL.city}, {LEGAL.country}, {LEGAL.email}:<br />
    I/We hereby give notice that I/we withdraw from my/our contract for the supply of the following digital content:
    Godmode ___ · Ordered on ___ · Name ___ · Address ___ · Date ___ · Signature (only on paper)
  </p>
</Legal>
